{"term":{"label":"道","occurrences":17,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i","title":"盡心上","description":"孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"一","id":"一"},{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"中","id":"中"},{"form":"使","id":"使"},{"form":"命","id":"命"},{"form":"執","id":"執"},{"form":"志","id":"志"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"樂","id":"樂"},{"form":"正","id":"正"},{"form":"殺","id":"殺"},{"form":"求","id":"求"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"身","id":"身"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"達","id":"達"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.7137664677626809,"source":"使","target":"道"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"志","target":"道"},{"weight":3.1986731175506815,"source":"正","target":"命"},{"weight":1.1192315758708453,"source":"正","target":"道"},{"weight":0.8472978603872037,"source":"命","target":"下"},{"weight":1.1192315758708453,"source":"命","target":"道"},{"weight":0.20294084399669038,"source":"樂","target":"道"},{"weight":1.1837700970084166,"source":"樂","target":"一"},{"weight":1.7227665977411035,"source":"下","target":"達"},{"weight":0.44183275227903923,"source":"下","target":"中"},{"weight":0.44183275227903923,"source":"下","target":"一"},{"weight":0.15415067982725836,"source":"下","target":"道"},{"weight":1.6945957207744073,"source":"聞","target":"一"},{"weight":0.7137664677626809,"source":"聞","target":"道"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"殺","target":"道"},{"weight":2.3877429013343527,"source":"殺","target":"一"},{"weight":1.8769172775683618,"source":"惡","target":"一"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"惡","target":"執"},{"weight":0.8960880245566357,"source":"惡","target":"道"},{"weight":3.1986731175506815,"source":"中","target":"執"},{"weight":1.6945957207744073,"source":"中","target":"一"},{"weight":0.7137664677626809,"source":"中","target":"道"},{"weight":0.8960880245566